      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Example\n\nA level indicator will receive the symbol **L** for the process variable \"Level\", and **I** for the \"Indicator\" type of instrument.\n\n**Combined ISA Code: LI**\n\nFor unique identification within a system, it is common to add a number to the ISA code. For example, the code for level indicator no. 8 would be: **LI-8** or **LI8**"
